        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add /model alias to end-session",
        "summary": "Added aliases: ['model'] to the end-session command in cli/src/commands/command-registry.ts and cli/src/data/slash-commands.ts. This allows users to trigger the session-end model picker using /model instead of /end-session. Updated slash command description to remove redundant waiting room reference.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T00:02:38.657Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you're done with a free chat session and want to pick a different model to switch to, you can now type /model instead of /end-session. Both commands take you to the same place, the screen where you choose your next model before rejoining the line. If you look closely, the list of slash commands also drops the extra note about the \"waiting room.\" This is live today for anyone using the free tier from the command line.",
